OL,3,AUS announces new tariffs on host of
OL,4,Acountries including China
OL,5,
OL,6,FChina is facing the highest tariff rate
OL,7,Fof up to 40%, followed by Vietnam at up
OL,8,Fto 35%, with others facing either 20%
OL,9,For 25%.
